ACKNOWLEDGEMENT

This project is an independent Python implementation whose command surface and
client behaviour are modelled on the prisma-airs-cli and prisma-airs-sdk
TypeScript projects maintained at https://github.com/cdot65, which are
themselves distributed under the MIT License. No source code was copied; the
Python implementation was written from scratch against the same public Palo
Alto Networks APIs, with the TypeScript projects used as a behavioural
reference for parity testing.
